sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as FastAPI Route
    participant TrackingService
    participant VoiceService as VoiceTranscriberService
    participant Whisper as Groq Whisper API
    participant LLM as LLM Gateway
    participant PgVector as pgvector (CentralFood)

    User->>+API: POST /tracking/meals/voice<br/>(audio file)
    Note over API: JWT auth extracts user_id

    API->>+TrackingService: voice_meal(user_id, audio)
    TrackingService->>+VoiceService: transcribe_and_parse_meal_log(audio)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over VoiceService,Whisper: Step 1: Speech-to-Text
        VoiceService->>+Whisper: Transcribe audio
        Whisper-->>-VoiceService: Raw text transcript
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over VoiceService,LLM: Step 2: Extract Structured Data
        VoiceService->>+LLM: Parse transcript into food items<br/>(names, quantities, units)
        LLM-->>-VoiceService: Structured JSON (food items)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over VoiceService,PgVector: Step 3: Match Foods
        loop For each identified food
            VoiceService->>+PgVector: Vector similarity search<br/>on CentralFood table
            PgVector-->>-VoiceService: Matched food with nutritional info
        end
    end

    VoiceService-->>-TrackingService: Matched foods + nutrition data
    TrackingService-->>-API: MealVoiceResponse
    API-->>-User: 200 OK<br/>{matched_foods[], nutritional_data}

    Note over User: User reviews matches,<br/>confirms via POST /tracking/logs
